\par\par \b \uc2  Israel  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2 : Inflation Guides Discount Rate \b0\par\par\uc2 274 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Juni 1997\par 13:34\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JERUSALEM (Dow Jones)--The Bank of Israel's discount rate will continue to be guided by the government's inflation target, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's research chief said Sunday after the rapid depreciation of the shekel fueled fears of an interest rate hike. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading as it has in the past to defend the shekel's trading band, but it won't disclose any other red lines that might trigger \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , a Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  spokesman cited research department head Leo Leiderman as saying at a monthly gathering of economics reporters. \par \par \uc2  The shekel depreciated some 5% in just over a week after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  widened the trading band on June 18, leading some analysts to wonder how precipitiously the shekel might be allowed to decline before the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prop it up. \par \par \uc2  On Friday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixed the shekel at 3.5920 to the dollar, compared to 3.4190 to the shekel on June 19. \par \par \uc2  Leiderman said the Bank of Israel wants to let market forces determine the direction of the foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  He cautioned against drawing hasty conclusions from a depreciation that took place over the course of only one week. \par \par \uc2  Trends in inflation and underlying inflation must be determined on the basis of more than a week's time, he said. What the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will examine is how the changes in the shekel's value affect prices against the backdrop of Israel's economic slowdown and jobless rate, he said. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) DOW JONES EMERGING MARKETS REPORT 29-06-97 \par \par \uc2  1134GMT \par \par \uc2  1802 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020011006dt6t00718\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
