\par\par \b \uc2  Israel's Frenkel Will Weigh Rate Rise If Inflation Rises \b0\par\par\uc2 270 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Juni 1997\par 15:38\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JERUSALEM (Dow Jones)--Bank of Israel Governor Jacob Frenkel says he'll weigh a rise in the discount rate if inflation rises. \par \par \uc2  The shekel has depreciated 4.7% since the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  widened the trading band last week. The Bank of Israel fixed the shekel at 3.58 shekels Thursday, compared to 3.419 shekels on June 19, the first full day of the new trading band regime. \par \par \uc2  Frenkel told Israel radio he wasn't worried by the storm in the foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. While the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is monitoring events, it wants to let market forces "express themselves," he said. \par \par \uc2  The public mustn't be fooled into thinking that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  serves as an insurance policy against market forces, he said, referring to the possibility of Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stop the shekel's slide. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  must let people internalize the risks involved in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading, Frenkel said. \par \par \uc2  "There are no red lines for depreciation, whereas there are red lines for inflation," Frenkel said. \par \par \uc2  "If inflation continues to drop, then we will consider lowering the discount rate," he said. "If inflation rises, then we will consider raising the discount rate." \par \par \uc2  Frenkel cut the discount rate to 12.7% on June 19 from 13.9%. The new rate is to stay in force through July. \par \par \uc2  Inflation at the end of May was running around 9.5% in annualized terms, at the upper end of the government's 7% to 10% target. \par \par \uc2  -By Amy Teibel \par \par \uc2  (END) DOW JONES EMERGING MARKETS REPORT 26-06-97 \par \par \uc2  1338GMT \par \par \uc2  1802 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020011006dt6q009vc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
