\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Israel Central Bank \highlight\uc2  -3:  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Has Cost 1B Shekels \b0\par\par\uc2 271 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Juni 1997\par 15:13\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Meridor is a political rival of Netanyahu's in the Likud party. \par \par \uc2  The friction between them was aggravated by Meridor's failure to support the prime minister after he was implicated in a political blackmail case. A political vendetta had been widely expected, though Netanyahu denied on Wednesday that personal issues led to Meridor's resignation following the Cabinet vote on the trading band. \par \par \uc2  Meridor had objected to widening the trading band because he said it would aggravate the economic slowdown by appreciating the shekel and increase joblessness. \par \par \uc2  Frenkel wanted to widen the band because the bloated shekel has forced the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy billions of dollars this year to weaken the shekel and force it back within its band. \par \par \uc2  The shekel has been bloated by a high discount rate that has encouraged people to borrow in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  or raise capital abroad and convert the money into shekels. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Israel has spent 1 billion shekels so far this year to soak up the liquidity injected into the market as a result of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the head of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  department, Sylvia Piterman, said Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The trading band will be widened gradually over the next 12 months to plus or minus 15% from a midpoint, versus a current 7%. \par \par \uc2  The gradual manner in which it will be widened will prevent the shekel from appreciating nominally, and Israel's competitiveness won't be hurt as a result of the wider band, Frenkel said. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) DOW JONES EMERGING MARKETS REPORT 18-06-97 \par \par \uc2  1313GMT \par \par \uc2  1802 1803 1896 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020011006dt6i008vn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
