\par\par \b \uc2  Israel  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Volatile Over Trading Band Uncertainty \b0\par\par\uc2 282 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Juni 1997\par 13:40\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JERUSALEM (AP-Dow Jones)-- Israel's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market fluctuated sharply Wednesday, indicating the market's uncertainty following an expansion of the shekel's trading band and a reduction in the country's high discount rate. \par \par \uc2  'Everyone is being careful,' Gideon Sadeh, a senior dealer with Bank Leumi said, 'because they don't know what is happening.' \par \par \uc2  Bank of Israel Governor Yakov Frenkel announced Wednesday a 1.2% discount rate cut, to 12.7% from 13.9%, following a government decision to widen gradually the shekel's trading band within the coming year, allowing it to fluctuate 15% from either side of a midpoint. \par \par \uc2  Frenkel pushed for a wider band to reduce the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  into the foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. Since the beginning of the year, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has bought billions of dollars in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken the shekel. \par \par \uc2  Finance Minister Dan Meridor opposed the plan, saying it would lead to an appreciation of the shekel and higher unemployment. Meridor turned in his resignation Wednesday after the Cabinet approved the expanded trading band. \par \par \uc2  Yet Israeli \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers did not expect the market would be seriously influenced by the widened band. \par \par \uc2  Sadeh said midday trading volumes were low on Wednesday, but dollar values fell over a wide spread. \par \par \uc2  At 11:30 GMT, the dollar was trading within a range of 3.4200 shekels to 3.4400 shekels, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Dollar trading over the course of the day fell within a range of 3.40 to 3.46 shekels, compared to Tuesday's fixing at 3.4170 shekels, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 18-06-97 \par \par \uc2  1140GMT \par \par \uc2  1092 1849 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt6i04g0q\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
