\par\par \b \uc2  Uncertainty prevails in Israel markets, shekel up. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Tova Cohen \par \uc2 523 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Juni 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, June 17 (Reuter) - Failure to resolve the issue of the shekel's trading bands has generated a great deal of uncertainty in Israel's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and stock markets, traders said on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The shekel strengthened in early trading and the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on a small scale by buying dollars, a dealer at Bank Hapoalim said. \par \par \uc2  "Turnover is low and the spreads are very wide," he said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading at 3.3850/3.4000 shekels against Monday's representative rate of 3.4160. \par \par \uc2  "The market doesn't know what will happen," the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu announced after an all-night meeting with Finance Minister Dan Meridor and Bank of Israel Governor Jacob Frenkel that a foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reform and budget cut had been agreed. \par \par \uc2  But talks were to continue on Tuesday afternoon on the main issue outstanding -- the shekel's trading bands. \par \par \uc2  The stock market posted early morning supply of 80 million shekels against only seven million in demand. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the weakness was due in part to a closing of positions by options players on Monday afteroon. \par \par \uc2  But the market, which is heavily export-oriented, was also strongly influenced by the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  "The decision on the bands will be a major decision," Danniella Finn of Batucha Securities said. \par \par \uc2  Frenkel has pushed for a widening of the bands, which would give the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  some relief from the need to constantly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  High interest rates have buoyed the shekel, forcing the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy huge amounts of dollars to prevent the shekel from strengthening beyond its band. \par \par \uc2  Meridor strongly opposes a widening of the band, fearing it will lead to a further appreciation of the shekel, causing the economy to slow. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the issue has now turned into a political battle that may require a resolution by the entire cabinet. \par \par \uc2  Netanyahu has dismissed media speculation that Meridor could resign if the prime minister decided to widen the bands. \par \par \uc2  "It shouldn't be a political issue, it should be an economic one. What does the justice minister or the labour minister have to do with it. They are making a political decision on a purely economic issue," Finn said. \par \par \uc2  The shekel, pegged to a basket of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , is allowed to trade in a band of seven percent above or below a diagonal slope designed to devalue the Israeli \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  by six percent a year. \par \par \uc2  Finn said she believed that if the bands were widened the shekel would strengthen in the short term but then weaken, especially if Frenkel agreed to cut interest rates. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is due to announce next week the interest rate level for July. \par \par \uc2  Netanyahu did not provide details on the budget cut or \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market reform but Israel Radio said the cut would be 600 million shekels. \par \par \uc2  On Monday night Netanyahu said he would set a timetable for making the shekel fully convertible and for lifting most foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  restrictions. \par \par \uc2  -Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211 TCC \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt6h03wij\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
