 prevent the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from appreciating beyond its trading band. \par \par \uc2  Finance Minister Dan Meridor opposes a widening of the trading band, but the Bank of Israel has urged a widening of the band. \par \par \uc2  Speaking to reporters at Caesarea on Monday, Bank of Israel governor Jacob Frenkel said in response to a question on whether a decision had been taken on widening the band: "That's not an issue we need to decide. We are now talking about a variety of measures, all of which are consistent with increasing the freedom of Israelis and investors to operate in the economy, particularly in the area of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  liberalisation. \par \par \uc2  "In this regard, I believe that the prime minister, the finance minister and myself are getting close to a decision" \par \par \uc2  He would not comment on the timetable. \par \par \uc2  -- Tel Aviv newsroom: 972-3-537-2211 x233 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt6g042yo\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
