\par\par \b \uc2  Israeli shekel weakens against dollar. \b0\par\par\uc2 265 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Juni 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, June 12 (Reuter) - The Israeli shekel representative rate was fixed lower against the dollar on Thursday after the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rose in overseas markets, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The shekel weakened against the dollar following the rise of the dollar abroad," said a dealer at Bank Hapoalim. \par \par \uc2  He added that volume was low with traders net sellers of shekels by a small margin. "The business sector continues to take foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 -linked loans," he said. \par \par \uc2  The dealer said the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market but bought less than $100 million to support the basket. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly in the market to prevent the shekel from appreciating against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket. The shekel has been at the bottom end of its trading band against the basket since the start of the year. \par \par \uc2  The representative rate for the dollar was fixed at 3.4110 shekels, against 3.4010 on Tuesday. The basket, composed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, was fixed at 3.7040 against 3.7029 on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Israel did not set a representative rate on Wednesday because of the Jewish holiday of Shavuot. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses, the shekel traded against the yen at 2.9874 shekels per 100 yen compared with 3.0131 on Tuesday, and against the mark at 1.9777 shekels compared with 1.9870 on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  In late afternoon, the dollar was trading at 3.4100 shekels. \par \par \uc2  - Dan Gerstenfeld, Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211 x233 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt6c046zd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
