\par\par \b \uc2  Israeli shekel lower against dollar, basket. \b0\par\par\uc2 209 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Juni 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, June 4 (Reuter) - The Israeli shekel representative rate was fixed lower against the dollar and the basket of key foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wednesday in very active trading, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "Volume was relatively high today and the business sector converted foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  into shekels. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again in the market, buying more than $100 million to support the basket," said a dealer at \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  Discount Bank. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly in the market to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket, which has been trading at the bottom end of its trading band since the start of the year. \par \par \uc2  The representative rate for the dollar was fixed at 3.4130 shekels, against 3.4070 on Tuesday. The basket, composed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, was fixed at 3.6992 against 3.6985 Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses, the shekel traded against the yen at 2.9339 shekels per 100 yen compared with 2.9413 on Tuesday, and against the mark at 1.9725 shekels compared with 1.9758 on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  In the late afternoon, the dollar was trading at 3.40.. shekels. \par \par \uc2  -- Dan Gerstenfeld, Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt6404jp3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
