\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Israel \highlight\uc2  Shekel Weakens Vs Dollar, Bank Of  \highlight22\uc2 Israel Intervenes \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 262 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Juni 1997\par 15:20\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JERUSALEM (AP-Dow Jones)--The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought $100 million to $200 million on the foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Wednesday to weaken the shekel, which closed down slightly against the dollar in moderate-to-heavy volume, foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixed the shekel at 3.4130 to the dollar, a drop of 0.18% from Tuesday's close of 3.4070 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  The shekel traded within a range of 3.4090 to 3.4180 to the dollar, dealers said. Shortly after the fixing it was trading around 3.4110 to 3.4150 to the dollar, they said. \par \par \uc2  'The dollar strengthened (against the shekel) with the dollar around the world,' said Michal Rotlevy of United Mizrahi Bank. \par \par \uc2  Dollar sales heavily outstripped purchases, said Guy Lesher of Bank Hapoalim. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  daily in the past week to force the shekel back inside its trading band. \par \par \uc2  The shekel has strengthened as customers take advantage of the difference between Israel's high discount rate and lower rates for major foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to raise capital abroad and convert it into shekels. \par \par \uc2  The shekel is fixed daily against a basket of five \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  dominated by the dollar, weighted around 60%. \par \par \uc2  The shekel is fixed daily against a basket of five \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  dominated by the dollar, weighted around 60%. \par \par \uc2  On Wednesday, the basket closed at 3.6992 shekels, up 0.018% from Tuesday's close of 3.6985. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 04-06-97 \par \par \uc2  1320GMT \par \par \uc2  1092 1849 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt64042q3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
