\par\par \b \uc2  Israeli shekel steady against dollar and basket. \b0\par\par\uc2 218 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Juni 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, June 3 (Reuter) - The Israeli shekel representative rate was fixed almost unchanged against the dollar and the basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  Tuesday in thin trading, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "Trading was very quiet today and volume was low. Despite that, the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market, buying dollars, to support the basket which fell below the lower edge of the trading band," said Gideon Sadeh of Bank Leumi. \par \par \uc2  He estimated that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchased $70 million. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly in the market to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket, which has been trading at the bottom end of its trading band for four months. \par \par \uc2  The representative rate for the dollar was fixed at 3.4070 shekels, against 3.4060 on Monday. The basket, composed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, was fixed at 3.6985 against 3.6980 Monday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses, the shekel traded against the yen at 2.9413 shekels per 100 yen compared with 2.9259 on Monday, and against the mark at 1.9758 shekels compared with 1.9794 on Monday. \par \par \uc2  In the late afternoon, the dollar was trading at 3.4070 shekels. \par \par \uc2  - Dan Gerstenfeld, Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211 x233 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt6304hpg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
