\par\par \b \uc2  Israeli shekel falls sharply against the dollar. \b0\par\par\uc2 238 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Juni 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, June 2 (Reuter) - The Israeli shekel representative rate was fixed sharply lower against the dollar on Monday following the rise of the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the mark on overseas markets, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The shekel declined against the dollar as the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rose sharply against the mark abroad following the French election," said a dealer at Bank Hapoalim. \par \par \uc2  "The rise of dollar pushed the basket of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  downwards and the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market on a relatively big scale buying more than $100 million to support the basket," he said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly in the market to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket, which has been trading at the bottom end of its trading band for four months. \par \par \uc2  The representative rate for the dollar was fixed at 3.4060 shekels, against 3.3940 on Friday. The basket, composed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, was fixed at 3.6980 against 3.6962 Friday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses, the shekel traded against the yen at 2.9259 shekels per 100 yen compared with 2.9202 on Friday, and against the mark at 1.9794 shekels compared with 1.9964 on Friday. \par \par \uc2  In the late afternoon, the dollar was trading at 3.4080 shekels. \par \par \uc2  - Dan Gerstenfeld, Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211 x233 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Doku