\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Israel \highlight\uc2  Shekel Weakens Vs Dlr,  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank Intervenes \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 261 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Juni 1997\par 16:10\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JERUSALEM (AP-Dow Jones)--The shekel weakened against the dollar Monday in heavy trading after the dollar strengthened against the Deutsche mark, foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Israel bought $100 million in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken the shekel back to its trading band, dealers estimated. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixed the shekel at 3.4060 to the dollar versus Friday's close at 3.3940. Shortly after the fixing, the shekel traded at 3.4070 to 3.41 to the dollar, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Shortly after the fixing, the shekel traded at 3.4070 to 3.41 to the dollar, dealers said. The dollar traded within a range of 3.4020 shekels to 3.4100 shekels. \par \par \uc2  The shekel is fixed daily against a basket of five \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  dominated by the dollar, weighted around 60%. \par \par \uc2  The shekel was trading all day around its strongest point in the trading band, and the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken it, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The basket was fixed at 3.6980 shekels, up 0.048% from 3.6962 on Friday. \par \par \uc2  Customers have been taking advantage of Israel's high discount rate to take out loans in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  or raise capital abroad and convert the money to shekels. \par \par \uc2  The capital inflows have strengthened the shekel, and in the first three months of the year alone, the Bank of Israel was forced to buy $5 billion worth of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to defend its trading band. \par \par \uc2  -By Amy Teibel \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 02-06-97 \par \par \uc2  1410GMT \par \par \uc2  1092 1849 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt62040vq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
