\par\par \b \uc2  Israeli shekel stable against dollar, basket. \b0\par\par\uc2 263 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Mai 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, May 29 (Reuter) - The Israeli shekel representative rate was fixed unchanged against the dollar and the basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Thursday after the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the basket, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The trend of conversions of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  into shekels which started on Tuesday after the rate decision continued today," said Ilan Zadka at United Mizrahi Bank. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Israel said on Monday it was holding its key lending rate for June at an annualised 13.9 percent, a level unchanged since the end of February. \par \par \uc2  "We saw also some converisons of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  for end-of-the-month payments. The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to support the basket buying dollars on a relatively low scale of $30 million," Zadka said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly in the market to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket, which has stayed at the bottom end of its trading band for four months. \par \par \uc2  The representative rate for the dollar was fixed at 3.3950 shekels, unchanged from Wednesday. The basket, composed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, was fixed at 3.6957, unchanged from Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses, the shekel traded against the yen at 2.9198 shekels per 100 yen compared with 2.9279 on Wednesday, and against the mark at 1.9938 shekels compared with 1.9940 on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  In the late afternoon, the dollar was trading at 3.3940 shekels. \par \par \uc2  - Dan Gerstenfeld, Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-221 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt5t04rn6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
