\par\par \b \uc2  Bank of Israel Buys Foreign  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\uc2  After 3-Week Hiatus \b0\par\par\uc2 265 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Mai 1997\par 16:14\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JERUSALEM (AP-Dow Jones)--The Bank of Israel bought foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday for the first time in nearly three weeks to weaken the shekel and bring it back within its trading band, foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixed the shekel at 3.3950 to the dollar, a drop of 0.029% over Tuesday's close of 3.3940 shekels. Shortly after the fixing, dealers said the spot rate was 3.3910 to 3.3940 shekels to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  The shekel traded within a range of 3.3920 to 3.3970 to the dollar in moderate and quiet trading, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Brisk sales on Tuesday strengthened the shekel to its strongest point within its trading band, and dealers predicted the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be forced to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers estimated on Wednesday that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought $50 million to $80 million. \par \par \uc2  The shekel is fixed daily against a basket of five \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  dominated by the dollar, weighted around 60%. The basket was fixed at 3.6957 shekels, up 0.027% from 3.6947 on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Customers have been taking advantage of Israel's high discount rate to take out loans in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  or raise capital abroad and convert the money to shekels. \par \par \uc2  The capital inflows have strengthened the shekel, and in the first three months of the year alone, the Bank of Israel was forced to buy $5 billion worth of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to defend its trading band. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 28-05-97 \par \par \uc2  1414GMT \par \par \uc2  1092 1849 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt5s03wio\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
