\par\par \b \uc2  Israeli shekel weakens against dollar, basket. \b0\par\par\uc2 277 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Mai 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, May 28 (Reuter) - The Israeli shekel representative rate was fixed slightly lower against the dollar and the basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday after the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the basket, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "Trading was very quiet today with slightly more conversions of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  into shekels. The basket (which on Tuesday reached the bottom edge of its trading band) continued to decline and the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said a dealer at \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  Discount Bank. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly in the market to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket, which has been trading at the bottom end of its trading band for four months. \par \par \uc2  The dealer said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to the tune of $80 million to support the basket. \par \par \uc2  The basket came under renewed pressure following the decision of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday to hold its key lending rate for June at an annualised 13.9 percent, the level at which it has been since the end of February. \par \par \uc2  The representative rate for the dollar was fixed at 3.3950 shekels against 3.3940 on Tuesday. The basket, composed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, was fixed at 3.6957 shekels against 3.6947 on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses, the shekel traded against the yen at 2.9279 shekels per 100 yen compared with 2.9335 on Tuesday, and against the mark at 1.9940 shekels compared with 1.9969 on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  In the late afternoon, the dollar was trading at 3.3945 shekels. \par \par \uc2  - Dan Gerstenfeld, Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt5s04tn1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
