\par\par \b \uc2  Israeli shekel gains on dollar. \b0\par\par\uc2 261 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Mai 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, May 7 (Reuter) - The Israeli shekel's representative rate was fixed higher against the dollar on Wednesday following the decline of the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the mark and yen, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The shekel rose today following the decline of the dollar in Europe. The banks were very active today using the opportunity that the next spot is for Tuesday," said a dealer. \par \par \uc2  On Monday, Israeli Independence Day, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will not set a representative rate making Tuesday the next day for setting spot rates as these are set three trading days ahead. \par \par \uc2  "The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again in the market, buying more than $100 million to support the basket," said Ilan Zadka, a trader at United Mizrahi Bank. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly in the market to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket, which has been trading at the bottom end of its band for three months. \par \par \uc2  The representative rate for the dollar was fixed at 3.4040 shekels against 3.4100 on Tuesday. The basket, composed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, was fixed at 3.6829 shekels against 3.6825 on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses, the shekel traded against the yen at 2.7208 shekels per 100 yen compared with 2.7090 on Tuesday, and against the mark at 1.9779 shekels compared with 1.9714 on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  In the late afternoon, the dollar was trading at 3.4020 shekels. \par \par \uc2  - Dan Gerstenfeld, Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt5705zue\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
