\par\par \b \uc2  Israeli shekel weakens against dollar, basket. \b0\par\par\uc2 270 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Mai 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, May 1 (Reuter) - The Israeli shekel's representative rate was fixed slightly lower against the dollar and the basket of key foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Thursday in mixed trading, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "Trading was mixed and balanced today with slightly more conversions of shekels into dollars," said a dealer at Israel Discount Bank. \par \par \uc2  He attributed the shekel's decline to several big deals made by the business sector in which dollars were purchased. \par \par \uc2  The trader said the basket rose mildly, making it unnecessary for the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly in the market to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket, which has been trading at the bottom end of its band for three months. \par \par \uc2  Figures published on Thursday by the Central Bureau of Statistics show that during the first four months of 1997 the dollar rose by 4.8 percent against the shekel. In March alone the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  gained 1.4 percent against the shekel. \par \par \uc2  The representative rate for the dollar was fixed at 3.4100 shekels against 3.4070 on Wednesday. The basket, composed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, was fixed at 3.6804 shekels against 3.6788 on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses, the shekel traded against the yen at 2.6824 shekels per 100 yen compared with 2.6877 on Wednesday, and against the mark at 1.9744 shekels compared with 1.9726 on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  In the late afternoon, the dollar was trading at 3.4100 shekels. \par \par \uc2  - Dan Gerstenfeld, Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt51069bw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
