\par\par \b \uc2  Israeli shekel weakens against dollar. \b0\par\par\uc2 240 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 April 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, April 29 (Reuter) - The shekel weakened against the dollar on Tuesday in dull trading reflecting the firm U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  abroad, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Late afternoon, the dollar was trading at 3.4097 shekels. \par \par \uc2  "Trading was very quiet today and the shekel weakened against the dollar after the dollar rose against the mark on Monday," said a dealer at Bank Hapoalim. \par \par \uc2  "The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market on a relatively low scale," he said, adding it was buying dollars to prevent a fall in the basket of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , against which the shekel is measured, below its trading band. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly in the market to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket, which has been trading at the bottom its band for three months. \par \par \uc2  The representative rate for the dollar was fixed at 3.4100 shekels against 3.4010 on Friday. The basket, composed of the dollar, mark, sterling, French franc and yen, was fixed at 3.6785 shekels against 3.6778 on Friday. \par \par \uc2  On Monday the Bank of Israel did not set a representative rate because of the Jewish Passover holiday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses, the shekel traded at 2.6918 per 100 yen compared with 2.6981 on Friday, and against the mark at 1.9690 compared with 1.9819 on Friday. \par \par \uc2  - Dan Gerstenfeld, Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211 \par \par \uc2  DMG SAS \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt4t06in1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
