\par\par \b \uc2  Israeli shekel falls against dollar, basket. \b0\par\par\uc2 245 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 April 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, April 7 (Reuter) - The Israeli shekel's representative rate was fixed sharply lower against the dollar and the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket on Monday after the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  surged in Europe against the yen, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The day opened with a sharp jump of the dollar following its rise abroad. When the dollar reached 3.3820 shekels investors used the opportunity to sell dollars and the shekel recovered mildly," said Zahi Eleas, a dealer at Bank Leumi. \par \par \uc2  "The basket traded today at the bottom (of its trading band) and the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market, buying dollars on a relatively low scale," Elias added. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly in the market to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket, which has been trading at the bottom end of its band for two months. \par \par \uc2  The representative rate for the dollar was fixed at 3.3810 shekels against 3.3610 on Friday. The basket, composed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, was fixed at 3.6651 shekels against 3.6636 on Friday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses, the shekel traded against the yen at 2.6982 shekels per 100 yen compared with 2.7166 on Friday, and against the mark at 1.9856 shekels after 2.0087 on Friday. \par \par \uc2  In the late afternoon, the dollar was trading at 3.3800 shekels. \par \par \uc2  - Dan Gerstenfeld, Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt4707p4k\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
