\par\par \b \uc2  Bank of  \highlight22\uc2 Israel Intervenes \highlight\uc2  to Weaken Shekel \b0\par\par\uc2 228 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 April 1997\par 17:12\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JERUSALEM (AP-Dow Jones)--The Bank of Israel bought large amounts of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wednesday to weaken the shekel as heavy dollar sales continued, foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The shekel remained unchanged from Tuesday's close of 3.3570 shekels to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Market volume was heavy, and the dollar traded within a narrow range of 3.3535 shekels to 3.3565 shekels, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  To offset heavy dollar sales, the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep the shekel within its trading band, buying between $170 million to $200 million in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The basket of five major international \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  against which the shekel is adjusted closed Wednesday at 3.6625 shekels, up 0.021% from 3.6617 shekels at Tuesday's close. \par \par \uc2  Dollar sales were heavy because Israeli companies have been converting foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  into shekels to pay salaries, said David Ziperstein of Eurotrust Ltd. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily and almost daily in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading since the beginning of the year. Dealers said they expect the trend to continue. \par \par \uc2  The only thing that will prevent heavy dollar sales is a discount rate cut or a depreciation of the shekel, Ziperstein said. The discount rate is 13.9% after seven recent cuts. \par \par \uc2  -Michele Gershberg \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 02-04-97 \par \par \uc2  1512GMT \par \par \uc2  1092 1849 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt4202eq3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
