\par\par \b \uc2  Israeli shekel unchanged against dollar. \b0\par\par\uc2 241 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 April 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, April 2 (Reuter) - The Israeli shekel's representative rate was fixed unchanged against the dollar on Wednesday after the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market on a relatively large scale, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The shekel closed unchanged today after the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in trading, buying dollars on a high scale to support the basket," said a dealer at Israel Discount Bank. \par \par \uc2  Dealers estimated that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought more than $200 million to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly in the market to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket, which has been trading at the bottom end of its band for two months. \par \par \uc2  "The business sector continues to take foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 -linked loans knowing that the shekel will remain at the bottom of the trading band," the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The representative rate for the dollar was fixed at 3.3570 shekels, unchanged from Tuesday. The basket, composed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, was fixed at 3.6625 shekels against 3.6617 on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses, the shekel traded against the yen at 2.7425 shekels per 100 yen compared with 2.7136 on Tuesday, and against the mark at 2.0078 shekels after 2.0100 on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  In the late afternoon, the dollar was trading at 3.3550 shekels. \par \par \uc2  - Dan Gerstenfeld, Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-