\par\par \b \uc2  Israeli shekel gains,  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  buys dollars. \b0\par\par\uc2 249 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 April 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, April 1 (Reuter) - The Israeli shekel's representative rate was fixed higher against the dollar on Tuesday after the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  declined on overseas markets, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought dollars to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate. \par \par \uc2  "The shekel rose against the dollar following the decline of the dollar abroad after sharp falls in U.S. markets," said Guy Levi at Bank Leumi. \par \par \uc2  "The dollar's decline pushed the basket below the lower edge of the trading band and the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market, buying dollars, on a relatively high scale," Levi said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly in the market to defend the basket, which has been trading at the bottom end of its band for two months. \par \par \uc2  "Volume was high after a four-day Easter break," Levi added. \par \par \uc2  The representative rate for the dollar was fixed at 3.3570 shekels against 3.3610 on Thursday. The basket, composed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, was fixed at 3.6617 shekels against 3.6587 on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses, the shekel traded against the yen at 2.7136 shekels per 100 yen compared with 2.7205 on Thursday, and against the mark at 2.0100 shekels after 2.0007 on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  In the late afternoon, the dollar was trading at 3.3530 shekels. \par \par \uc2  - Dan Gerstenfeld, Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt41083ei\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
