\par\par \b \uc2  Israel Shekel Strengthens Against Dollar \b0\par\par\uc2 260 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1997\par 15:00\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JERUSALEM (AP-Dow Jones)--The shekel strengthened against the dollar on Thursday after the dollar weakened on major international markets, said foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer Guy Levy of Bank Leumi. \par \par \uc2  Dealers at three major banks said the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixed the dollar at 3.3610 shekels, down 0.267% from Wednesday's close of 3.37 shekels. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said trading volume was moderate to brisk, with trade picking up in the afternoon in the form of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  sales. \par \par \uc2  A dealer at the First International Bank of Israel speculated that corporations were selling foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to pay end-of-the-month taxes and wages. \par \par \uc2  The dollar traded within a range of 3.3590 shekels to 3.3650 shekels, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The shekel has been bloated by a discount rate that is so high relative to those for other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  - 13.9% - that customers borrow in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  or raise capital abroad and convert the money to shekels. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been buying foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  almost daily to keep the shekel from strengthening beyond the strongest point within its trading band. \par \par \uc2  The dollar dominates a basket of five \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  against which the shekel is adjusted, and the Bank of Israel fixes rates for the dollar and the basket each session. \par \par \uc2  On Thursday, the basket closed down 0.013% to 3.6587 shekels from Wednesday's fixing of 3.6592 shekels. \par \par \uc2  -Amy Teibel \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 27-03-97 \par \par \uc2  1400GMT \par \par \uc2  1092 1849 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt3r029ax\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
