\par\par \b \uc2  Israel Shekel Weakens Slightly Vs Dlr In Moderate Trading \b0\par\par\uc2 269 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1997\par 14:43\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JERUSALEM (AP-Dow Jones)--The shekel weakened slightly against the dollar Wednesday, and dealers said the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading as it has almost daily since early January. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Israel fixed the dollar at 3.37 shekels, up 0.119% from Tuesday's close of 3.3660 shekels. \par \par \uc2  Trading volume was moderate, with demand for foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  slightly outstripping supply. \par \par \uc2  The dollar traded within a range of 3.3650 shekels to 3.3730 shekels, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Some buyers took advantage of the Good Friday and Easter bank closures around the world to buy lower than the spot rate, said Ilan Engel of Koor Capital Markets. \par \par \uc2  The shekel has been bloated by a discount rate that is so high relative to those for other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  - 13.9% after seven recent cuts - that customers borrow in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  or raise capital abroad and convert the money to shekels. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been buying foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  almost daily to keep the shekel from strengthening beyond the strongest point within its trading band. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Wednesday's market, according to Engel and dealers at Israel's top three banks. \par \par \uc2  The dollar dominates a basket of five \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  against which the shekel is adjusted, and the Bank of Israel fixes rates for the dollar and the basket each session. \par \par \uc2  On Wednesday, the basket closed at 3.6592 shekels, up 0.049% compared with 3.6574 shekels Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  -Amy Teibel \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 26-03-97 \par \par \uc2  1343GMT \par \par \uc2  1092 1849 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt3q027sp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
