\par\par \b \uc2  Israeli shekel weakens against dollar, basket. \b0\par\par\uc2 228 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, March 26 (Reuter) - The Israeli shekel's representative rate was fixed slightly lower against the dollar and the basket of key foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday following the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rise abroad, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The dollar rose in Europe following the 25-basis-point rate increase of the Federal Reserve. In local trading the shekel declined mildly following the rise of the dollar," said a dealer at Bank Hapoalim. \par \par \uc2  "The basket rose slightly and the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not need to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  today," the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly in the market to defend the basket of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has been trading at the bottom end of its band for two months. \par \par \uc2  The representative rate for the dollar was fixed at 3.3700 shekels against 3.3660 on Tuesday. The basket, composed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, was fixed at 3.6592 shekels against 3.6574 on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses, the shekel traded against the yen at 2.7131 shekels per 100 yen compared with 2.7245 on Tuesday, and against the mark at 1.9931 shekels after 1.9959 on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  In the late afternoon, the dollar was trading at 3.3700 shekels. \par \par \uc2  - Dan Gerstenfeld, Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt3q086g5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\pi