r \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  - 13.9% after seven recent cuts - so customers continue to borrow in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  or raise capital abroad and convert the money to shekels. \par \par \uc2  -Amy Teibel \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 19-03-97 \par \par \uc2  1529GMT \par \par \uc2  1092 1849 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt3j01y6t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
