\par\par \b \uc2  Israeli shekel little changed vs dollar. \b0\par\par\uc2 246 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, March 18 (Reuter) - The Israeli shekel representative rate was fixed almost unchanged against the dollar and the basket of key foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday in quiet trading, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "Activity was relatively low today and the shekel in early trading rose against the dollar following the rise of the mark against the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said a dealer at Israel Discount Bank. \par \par \uc2  "Once again the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market buying dollars to support the basket. Because of the low activity, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to buy only $70 million. Following the bank's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  the dollar rose, closing almost unchanged," he said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly in the market to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket rate, which has been trading at the bottom end of its band for two months. \par \par \uc2  The representative rate for the dollar was fixed at 3.3670 shekels against 3.3660 on Monday. The basket, composed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, was fixed at 3.6536 shekels against 3.6529 on Monday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses, the shekel traded against the yen at 2.7405 shekels per 100 yen compared with 2.7244 on Monday, and against the mark at 1.9967 shekels after 1.9970 on Monday. \par \par \uc2  In the late afternoon, the dollar was trading at 3.3645 shekels. \par \par \uc2  - Dan Gerstenfeld, Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt3i08jum\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
