\par\par \b \uc2  Israeli shekel strengthens against dollar. \b0\par\par\uc2 234 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, March 13 (Reuter) - The Israeli shekel representative rate was fixed higher against the dollar on Thursday following the weakening of the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on overseas markets, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "Activity rose slightly today because the business sector was converting foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  (into shekels) for mid-month tax payments. The dollar declined abroad and this led to the shekel's rise," said a dealer at \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  Discount Bank. \par \par \uc2  "The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again in the market buying dollars to support the basket. I believe that it purchased less than $100 million," the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly in the market to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket rate, which has been trading at the bottom end of its band for two months. \par \par \uc2  The representative rate for the dollar was fixed at 3.3650 shekels against 3.3730 on Wednesday. The basket, composed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, was fixed at 3.6507 shekels against 3.6504 on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses the shekel traded against the yen at 2.7402 shekels per 100 yen compared with 2.7477 on Wednesday, and against the mark at 1.9864 shekels after 1.9757 on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  In the late afternoon, the dollar was trading at 3.3635 shekels. \par \par \uc2  - Dan Gerstenfeld, Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997