\par\par \b \uc2  Israeli shekel weakens against dollar. \b0\par\par\uc2 220 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, March 12 (Reuter) - The Israeli shekel representative rate was fixed lower against the dollar on Wednesday in dull trading, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The market continues to be extremely quiet. Trading was affected by the sterling's slide abroad, which pushed the basket downwards," said a dealer at United Mizrahi Bank. \par \par \uc2  "The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  was forced to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market after the basket fell to more than seven percent below the diagonal rate. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought almost $100 million," she said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly in the market to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket rate, which has been trading at the bottom end of its band for two months. \par \par \uc2  The representative rate for the dollar was fixed at 3.3730 shekels against 3.3680 on Tuesday. The basket, composed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, was fixed at 3.6504 shekels against 3.6502 on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses the shekel traded against the yen at 2.7477 shekels per 100 yen compared with 2.7681 on Tuesday, and against the mark at 1.9757 shekels after 1.9745 on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  In the late afternoon, the dollar was trading at 3.3710 shekels. \par \par \uc2  - Dan Gerstenfeld, Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt3c08s0c\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
