\par\par \b \uc2  Israel Shekel Weakens 0.03% In Quiet Trading \b0\par\par\uc2 257 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1997\par 18:27\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JERUSALEM (AP-Dow Jones)-- The shekel weakened against the dollar in quiet trading on Monday. The weakening of the shekel reflected mostly developments in international markets, a tend that has been in effect for the past weeks, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar closed at 3.370 shekels, up 0.03% from Friday's closing of 3.3690. \par \par \uc2  The dollar ranged from 3.3670 shekels to 3.37 shekels throughout the day, traders said. They added that the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prevent the shekel from closing outside the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's trading band. \par \par \uc2  The bank spent the equivalent of $150 million to purchase foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . ``On Friday, for the first time in several days, the Bank did not have to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . But today the private sector again sold large amounts of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' said Ilan Zedaka, a dealer with United Mizrachi Bank. \par \par \uc2  The dollar dominates a basket of major international \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  against which the shekel is adjusted, and the Bank of Israel fixes rates for both the dollar and the basket each session. The shekel closed at 3.6491 against the basket, down 0.04% from Friday's closing of 3.6475 shekels. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ``There is almost no news in the market. Each day is very similar to\par the previous one. The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervenes\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  at closing time and\par prevents the shekel from strengthening beyond the trading band limit'',\par said Yael Geltman, a trader with Bank Leumi.\par    -Avi Temkin\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 10-03-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1727GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1092 1849 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt3a01q3j\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
