\par\par \b \uc2  Israeli shekel little changed against dollar. \b0\par\par\uc2 244 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, March 10 (Reuter) - The Israeli shekel representative rate was fixed almost unchanged against the dollar on Monday in trendless trading, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "It's the same old story, the basket is still trading at seven percent below the diagonal rate and the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again in the market buying dollars to support the basket," said a dealer at Bank Hapoalim. \par \par \uc2  "The dollar was stable abroad and the representative rate of the dollar was set slightly higher. Overall we saw a slight increase in the supply of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to raise the sum it purchased," the dealer added. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly in the market to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket rate, which has been trading at the bottom end of its band for two months. \par \par \uc2  The representative rate for the dollar was fixed at 3.3700 shekels against 3.3690 on Friday. The basket, composed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, was fixed at 3.6491 shekels against 3.6475 on Friday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses the shekel traded against the yen at 2.7661 shekels per 100 yen against 2.7781 on Friday and against the mark at 1.9725 shekels against 1.9644 on Friday. \par \par \uc2  In late afternoon the dollar was trading at 3.3675 shekels. \par \par \uc2  - Dan Gerstenfeld, Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lb