\par\par \b \uc2  Israeli shekel declines against dollar. \b0\par\par\uc2 215 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, March 6 (Reuter) - The Israeli shekel representative rate was fixed lower against the dollar on Thursday in dull trading, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The market continues to be very quiet and volume was low," said Ilan Zadka at United Mizrahi Bank. "The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market (buying dollars) to support the basket after the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rose abroad." \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on a relatively small scale buying around $50 million," Zadka said. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly in the market to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket rate, which has been trading at the bottom end of its band for nearly two months. \par \par \uc2  The representative rate for the dollar was fixed at 3.3700 shekels against 3.3670 on Tuesday. The basket, composed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, was fixed at 3.6467 shekels against 3.6466 on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses the shekel traded against the yen at 2.7738 shekels per 100 yen against 2.7731 on Wednesday and against the mark at 1.9607 shekels against 1.9650 on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  In late afternoon the dollar was trading at 3.3695 shekels. \par \par \uc2  - Dan Gerstenfeld, Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt360919j\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
