\par\par \b \uc2  Israeli shekel weakens against dollar. \b0\par\par\uc2 215 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, March 5 (Reuter) - The Israeli shekel representative rate was fixed slightly lower against the dollar on Wednesday in very quiet trading, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "Nothing happened today and the shekel closed only slighty lower against the dollar," said a dealer at Bank Hapoalim. "Activity was very low and the only player in the market was the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  who had to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to support the basket." \par \par \uc2  The dealer said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on a relatively small scale. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket rate, which has been trading at the bottom end of its band for nearly two months. \par \par \uc2  The representative rate for the dollar was fixed at 3.3670 shekels against 3.3630 on Tuesday. The basket, composed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, was fixed at 3.6466 shekels against 3.6454 on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses the shekel traded against the yen at 2.7731 shekels per 100 yen against 2.7606 on Tuesday and against the mark at 1.9650 shekels against 1.9681 on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  In late afternoon the dollar was trading at 3.3630 shekels. \par \par \uc2  - Dan Gerstenfeld, Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt3508zmq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
