\par\par \b \uc2  Israel Shekel Weakens; Quiet Trade; Nat Bank Sold Shekels \b0\par\par\uc2 271 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1997\par 16:59\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JERUSALEM (AP-Dow Jones)--The shekel weakened against the dollar in quiet trading on Tuesday as the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  at the close to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from appreciating outside its trading band. \par \par \uc2  The shekel closed at 3.3630 shekels per dollar, down 0.15% from Monday's close of 3.3530. \par \par \uc2  The dollar ranged from 3.3580 shekels to 3.3640 shekels throughout the day, traders said. They added that the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  at the end of the day to prevent the shekel from trading outside the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's trading band. \par \par \uc2  In trading Tuesday, the bank sold shekels to buy the equivalent of $150 million in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 , said Yael Geltman a trader with Bank Leumi. There has been no change in the trading trend of the past few weeks, he said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar dominates a basket of major international \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  against which the shekel is adjusted, and the Bank of Israel fixes rates for both the dollar and the basket each session. The shekel closed at 3.646 against the basket, down from Monday close of 3.645 shekels. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading for the past weeks to keep the shekel from strengthening beyond its strongest point within the trading band. \par \par \uc2  The private sector is selling dollars to take advantage of high shekel interest rates, and the Bank of Israel is forced to purchase the foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , said Yael Altman, a trader with United Mizrachi Bank. \par \par \uc2  - Avi Temkin \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 04-03-97 \par \par \uc2  1559GMT \par \par \uc2  1092 1849 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt3401kcr\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
