\par\par \b \uc2  Israeli shekel sharply lower against dollar. \b0\par\par\uc2 221 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, March 4 (Reuter) - The Israeli shekel representative rate was fixed sharply lower against the dollar on Tuesday after the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rallied to a 34-month high against the mark, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The shekel continued to decline against the dollar following the dollars rise against the mark and yen," said a dealer at \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  Discount Bank. \par \par \uc2  "The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again in the market after the basket fell by more than seven percent below the diagonal rate," he added. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly in the market to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket rate, which has been trading at the bottom end of its band for nearly two months. \par \par \uc2  The representative rate for the dollar was fixed at 3.3630 shekels against 3.3530 on Monday. The basket, composed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, was fixed at 3.6454 shekels against 3.6450 on Monday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses the shekel traded against the yen at 2.7606 shekels per 100 yen against 2.7791 on Monday and against the mark at 1.9681 shekels against 1.9805 on Monday. \par \par \uc2  In late afternoon the dollar was trading at 3.3615 shekels. \par \par \uc2  - Dan Gerstenfeld, Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt34095xf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgo