\par\par \b \uc2  Israel Shekel Weakens Against Dollar In Quiet Trading \b0\par\par\uc2 254 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Februar 1997\par 16:33\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JERUSALEM (AP-Dow Jones)-- The shekel weakened against the dollar in quiet trading Monday, reflecting developments in international markets, said Isaac Elias, a trader at Bank Leumi. \par \par \uc2  The dollar closed at 3.3510 shekels, up 0.30% from Thursday's close of 3.3410 shekels. There was no \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trade on Friday due to a banks' strike. \par \par \uc2  The dollar ranged from 3.3480 shekels to 3.3510 shekels throughout the day, traders said. They added that the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  at closing time to prevent the shekel from trading outside the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's trading band. \par \par \uc2  The bank spent well above $100 million in purchasing foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Elias said. He added that there had been a backlog of selling orders from Friday, which explains the sum spent by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The dollar dominates a basket of major international \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  against which the shekel is adjusted, and the Bank of Israel fixes rates for both the dollar and the basket each session. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading over the past few weeks to keep the shekel from strengthening beyond its strongest point within the trading band. \par \par \uc2  'Traders are skeptical about the possibility of a large interest rate cut. Therefore they see no reason for a change in the trend that has dominated the market over the past weeks,' said Ilan Zedaka, a dealer with United Mizrahi Bank. \par \par \uc2  -Avi Temkin \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 17-02-97 \par \par \uc2  1533GMT \par \par \uc2  1092 1849 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt2h0118f\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
