\par\par \b \uc2  Israeli shekel falls sharply against dollar. \b0\par\par\uc2 235 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Februar 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, Feb 17 (Reuter) - The Israeli shekel representative rate was fixed sharply lower against the dollar on Monday following \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The routine continues. The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  several times in the market to buy dollars after the basket fell by more than seven percent below the diagonal rate," said Guy Levi of Bank Leumi. \par \par \uc2  "The market was very quiet today and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was the only major player," he said. \par \par \uc2  Traders estimated the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought $100 million. \par \par \uc2  The shekel is allowed to fluctuate in a trading band of seven percent above or below a sloping mid-point designed to devalue the Israeli \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  at a rate of six percent a year against the basket of key \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The representative rate for the dollar was fixed at 3.3510 shekels against 3.3410 on Friday. The basket, composed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, was fixed at 3.6368 shekels against 3.6349 on Friday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses the shekel traded against the yen at 2.6983 shekels per 100 yen against 2.6938 on Friday and against the mark at 1.9776 shekels against 1.9866 on Friday. \par \par \uc2  In late afternoon the dollar was trading at 3.3480 shekels. \par \par \uc2  - Dan Gerstenfeld, Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lb