\par\par \b \uc2  Israeli shekel little changed vs dollar. \b0\par\par\uc2 266 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Februar 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, Feb 13 (Reuter) - The Israeli shekel changed little against the dollar on Thursday in mixed and aimless trading, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "Trading was mixed today with no clear trend. The shekel rose slightly because the business sector was converting dollars into shekels for mid-month tax payments," said Ilan Zadka at United Mizrahi Bank. \par \par \uc2  Zadka said investors had to convert money on Thursday because workers, dramatising their demand for a five-day work week, plan to shut down Israel's banks on Friday. \par \par \uc2  "The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again in the market after the basket fell by more than seven percent below the diagonal rate," Zadka said. \par \par \uc2  Traders estimated that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought less than $90 million. \par \par \uc2  The shekel is allowed to fluctuate in a trading band of seven percent above or below a sloping mid-point designed to devalue the Israeli \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  at a rate of six percent a year against the basket of key \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The representative rate for the dollar was fixed at 3.3410 shekels against 3.3420 on Wednesday. The basket, composed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, was fixed at 3.6349 shekels against 3.6337 on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses the shekel traded against the yen at 2.6938 shekels per 100 yen against 2.6940 on Wednesday and against the mark at 1.9866 shekels against 1.9819 on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  In late afternoon the dollar was trading at 3.3400 shekels. \par \par \uc2  - Dan Gerstenfeld, Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011003dt2d00cq5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
