\par\par \b \uc2  Israel Shekel Weakens Slightly Against Dollar \b0\par\par\uc2 206 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Februar 1997\par 16:24\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JERUSALEM (AP-Dow Jones)--The shekel closed down slightly to another record low against the dollar on Wednesday, depressed by the dollar's gain against the German mark on major \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said. \par \par \uc2  'Trading was thin and uneventful,' said dealer Guy Lesher of Bank Hapoalim. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Israel fixed the dollar at 3.3210 shekels, up 0.181% from Tuesday's close of 3.3160 shekels. The dollar began reaching record high levels on Jan. 28, when it was valued at 3.3190 shekels. \par \par \uc2  The dollar dominates a basket of major international \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  against which the shekel is adjusted, and the Bank of Israel fixes rates for both the dollar and the basket each session. \par \par \uc2  For nearly every day in the past few weeks, the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading to weaken the shekel and keep it within its trading band. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  again on Wednesday, but dealers described the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  as lighter than usual. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket was valued at 3.6297 shekels, a drop of 0.005% against Tuesday's close of 3.6299 shekels. \par \par \uc2  -Amy Teibel \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 05-02-97 \par \par \uc2  1524GMT \par \par \uc2  1092 1849 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt2500pf2\par }\page {\par\