\par\par \b \uc2  Israeli shekel weakens against dollar. \b0\par\par\uc2 294 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Februar 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, Feb 5 (Reuter) - The Israeli shekel weakened against the dollar on Wednesday following the rise of the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in overseas markets, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The dollar rose abroad and the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the local market to prevent the basket from falling by more than seven percent below the diagonal rate," said a dealer at United Mizrahi Bank. \par \par \uc2  The shekel is allowed to fluctuate in a trading band of seven percent above or below a sloping mid-point designed to devalue the Israeli \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  at a rate of six percent a year against the basket of key \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "I believe that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to invest less than $100 million today," he said. \par \par \uc2  On Sunday a Treasury official said the bank had spent more than $1 billion during January \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market. \par \par \uc2  "Overall volume was relatively low and investors showed little interest as they mourned the loss of life in the air crash," the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Seventy-three Israeli soldiers were killed when two military helicopters heading for Lebanon crashed on Tuesday in the worst air disaster in Israeli military history. \par \par \uc2  The representative rate for the dollar was fixed at 3.3220 shekels against 3.3160 on Tuesday. The basket, composed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, was fixed at 3.6297 shekels against 3.6299 on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses the shekel traded against the yen at 2.6908 shekels per 100 yen against 2.7141 on Tuesday and against the mark at 2.0113 shekels against 2.0197 on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  In late afternoon the dollar was trading at 3.3200 shekels. \par \par \uc2  - Dan Gerstenfeld, Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011003dt25030zd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
