\par\par \b \uc2  Israel Shekel Strengthens Slightly Against Dollar \b0\par\par\uc2 277 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Februar 1997\par 16:02\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JERUSALEM (AP-Dow Jones)-- The shekel strengthened slightly against the dollar on Tuesday in trading that dealers described as very quiet. \par \par \uc2  The shekel closed at 3.3160 to the dollar, a rise of 0.151% compared to Monday's close of 3.3218. \par \par \uc2  'It was a very quiet market,' said a foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at First International Bank of Israel. \par \par \uc2  Volume was moderate, and the dollar traded within a narrow range of 3.3140 shekels to 3.320 shekels, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar dominates a basket of major international \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  against which the shekel is adjusted, and the Bank of Israel fixes rates for both the dollar and the basket each session. \par \par \uc2  For nearly every day in the past few weeks, the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading to weaken the shekel and keep it within its trading band. \par \par \uc2  But \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't have to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday because the shekel didn't strengthen beyond the strongest point in the band. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket was valued at 3.6299 shekels, a rise of 0.033% against Monday's close of 3.6287 shekels. \par \par \uc2  'It was a boring and quiet day,' said Guy Levy, a senior trader on the dollar-shekel desk at Bank Leumi. 'A little respite from the pressure.' \par \par \uc2  The shekel has been bloated by a discount rate that is so high relative to those for other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  --  14.2% after six recent cuts -- that customers borrow in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  or raise capital abroad and convert the money to shekels. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 04-02-97 \par \par \uc2  1502GMT \par \par \uc2  1092 1849 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt2400qmf\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (israel near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clb